title: Tire Size Calibration (PCM / BCM Circumference)
raw_community_title: Tire Size - requires PCM Relearn procedure after change (2021-26)
category: Powertrain and Drivetrain
platform: F-150
model_years: 2021-26
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: First two digits of tire circumference in MM encoded in hex.  Check speed vs
  GPS, then tweak to correct speedometer with GSP speed
steps:
- module: BCM
  address: 726-15-01
  notes: First two digits of tire circumference in MM encoded in hex
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxxx **--
    type: continuous
    user_input: required
- module: BCM
  address: 726-15-02
  notes: Last two digits of tire circumference in MM encoded in hex
  targets:
  - mask: '**xx xxxx xx--'
    type: continuous
    user_input: required
recipe_version: '1.1'
